  "title": "Formal proof of the V_(3) per-irrep character difference closed form: $\\chi_{(3)}(\\beta_n) - \\chi_{(3)}(\\beta_p) = -(q^2 + 1)^2 (q^2 - 1)/(4q) = -(q^5 + q^3 - q - q^{-1})/4$, with explicit $\\varepsilon^k$ pattern via polynomial + geometric decomposition",
